diff --git a/.changes/unreleased/charts-redpanda-Added-20260908-160000.yaml b/.changes/unreleased/charts-redpanda-Added-20260908-160000.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..cd9427a7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changes/unreleased/charts-redpanda-Added-20260908-160000.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+project: charts/redpanda
+kind: Added
+body: |-
+    New `commonAnnotations` value adds the given annotations to every object the chart renders, including the StatefulSet itself. The StatefulSet's Pod template and volume claim templates are deliberately left unannotated: the claim templates are immutable on a live cluster, and annotating the Pod template would restart every broker. Annotations set on an individual resource take precedence. Useful for policy-engine required annotations or ArgoCD sync waves, for example `argocd.argoproj.io/sync-wave: "1"`.
+time: 2026-09-08T16:00:00.000000-07:00
diff --git a/.changes/unreleased/operator-Changed-20260912-090000.yaml b/.changes/unreleased/operator-Changed-20260912-090000.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..cc8913d9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changes/unreleased/operator-Changed-20260912-090000.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+project: operator
+kind: Changed
+body: |-
+    Breaking change for Redpanda Connect pipelines, which are still in beta: the operator chart's `commonAnnotations` value is renamed to `connectAnnotations`, and the operator's `--common-annotations` flag to `--connect-annotations`. The value only ever annotated the resources the Connect Pipeline controller creates, never the operator chart's own objects, so the old name read as a chart-wide knob it never was. Rename it before upgrading: the chart's values schema rejects unknown keys, so the old name fails `helm upgrade` rather than being silently ignored.
+time: 2026-09-12T09:00:00.000000-07:00
